    <description>This is a Record-Triggered Flow.
Upon triggering, this flow first retrieves the Messaging Session record using the provided &apos;recordId&apos;. It then sets the &apos;Next_Requested_Agent_Name__c&apos; field value into a variable named &apos;NextAgentName&apos;. Subsequently, it checks the value of &apos;NextAgentName&apos; and routes the session to the corresponding agent (Harshit Appointment Assistant, Sumit Prescription Specialist, Honey Insurance Insight Advisor, Vishal Emergency Response Agent, or Human Agent) using the &apos;routeWork&apos; action. If no agent name is set, it defaults to &apos;Anil Master Concierge&apos;.

Several objects and their fields worth mentioning. Below are the details (the format is given as: object_name - field_name: interaction)
  * MessagingSession - Id : Used to query the Messaging Session record.
  * MessagingSession - Next_Requested_Agent_Name__c : The field that determines the routing of the session.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
